'''Brutal Charge''' is an alternative [[charge]] of {{stl|Endurance Charge}}. It's currently only granted from {{il|Arn's Anguish}}'s mod {{c|mod|Gain Brutal Charges instead of Endurance Charges}}. Players can accumulate them the same way they generate endurance charges.

==Related unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s are related to brutal charge:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
